<title>JORDAN: Jordan Dec trade deficit narrowed 21 pct from Nov.</title>
<headline>Jordan Dec trade deficit narrowed 21 pct from Nov.</headline>
<dateline>AMMAN 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Jordan's December trade deficit narrowed by 21 percent to 128.52 million dinars from a revised 162.08 million dinars in November, the Central Bank bulletin said.</p>
<p>But the overall 1996 trade deficit widened sharply to 1.76 billion dinars from 1.35 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of dinars)</p>
<p>			   Dec 96    Nov 96   Dec 95     1996    1995</p>
<p>Domestic exports     105.75    89.26    102.00    1,039    1,004</p>
<p>Re-Exports		27.64    14.43     23.37	248	237</p>
<p>Imports		  261.91   266.77    201.51    3,043    2,590</p>
<p>Trade Balance	 -128.52  -163.08    -76.14   -1,756   -1,349</p>
<p>$1 = 0.7080 dinars</p>
<p>-- Amman newsroom 9626 623 776</p>
</text>
